xt-slate-400\">Use focused converters, compressors and editors for images, PDFs, audio and video from one searchable place.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"mb-8 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-5xl\">Homepage FAQ</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold\">Is A2ZConvertor free to use?</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-slate-400\">Yes. The current tools are free to use online without account registration.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold\">Are files uploaded to a server?</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-slate-400\">Many tools process files directly in your browser. Some workflows depend on browser support, and each tool page explains important output limitations where needed.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold\">Can I request a new tool?</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-slate-400\">Yes. Use the Request a Tool page to suggest new converters, editors or improvements to existing tools.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-6\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold\">Which tool categories are available?</h3><p class=\"leading-7 text-slate-400\">A2ZConvertor currently includes image, PDF, audio and video tools, with more launch-ready utilities planned.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-white/10 bg-amber-300/5 px-6 py-14\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase text-amber-200\">Keep free tools growing</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-black\">Support A2ZConvertor</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-300\">AI generations, hosting, development and new tools cost money. Your support helps us keep useful tools free and improve daily limits.</p><div